  "laws": [
    "THE SAME POINTED-OVAL SHAPE AT EVERY SIZE: a portal only shrinks, it never changes form; only size, veiling and light change between states.",
    "PURE LIGHT, NO HARDWARE: never a frame, ring, arch, standing stones, machine or doorsill; the lower tip always floats a hand's width above the forest floor.",
    "THE LIGHT IS WARM GOLD AND SOFT-EDGED like wet ink-wash with a thin brighter rim and a few small drifting gold motes; NEVER neon, NEVER a hard vector edge, NEVER a lens flare.",
    "THROUGH THE OPENING: warm light and open sky, never darkness, never a void; the island appears through it only when a scene asks by name.",
    "CLOSED IS A FLAT RING OF PALE GOLD BLOSSOMS on the forest floor, quiet and kind; no light, no scorch, nothing ominous.",
    "NO LETTERING, NO SIGN, NO NUMBER anywhere in any state."
  ]
